stence supplies no exact execution deadline.", "set": {"nodes": {"record": ["is-done", "still persisted"], "system": ["is-warn", "pending after reboot"]}}}, {"caption": "Later, all constraints hold and the system grants an execution opportunity. WorkManager starts this CoroutineWorker; the work becomes RUNNING.", "packets": [{"edge": "start", "label": "start", "tone": "fwd", "kind": "signal"}], "set": {"nodes": {"record": ["is-active", "RUNNING"], "system": ["is-done", "execution allowed"], "worker": ["is-active", "sync attempt"]}, "visuals": {"system": {"ready": true}, "worker": {"visible": true, "busy": true}}}}, {"caption": "The attempt returns Result.retry(). The work returns to ENQUEUED with its configured backoff. The paused interval is waiting, not activity between boxes.", "packets": [{"edge": "result", "label": "retry", "tone": "back", "kind": "parcel"}], "set": {"nodes": {"record": ["is-warn", "ENQUEUED · backoff"], "worker": ["is-warn", "retry requested"]}, "visuals": {"system": {"ready": false}, "worker": {"busy": false}}}}, {"caption": "Once eligible again, a later opportunity starts another attempt. Retried writes need idempotency; a failed attempt may already have reached the server.", "packets": [{"edge": "start", "label": "start", "tone": "fwd", "kind": "signal"}], "set": {"nodes": {"record": ["is-active", "RUNNING"], "worker": ["is-active", "next attempt"]}, "visuals": {"system": {"ready": true}, "worker": {"busy": true}}}}, {"caption": "This attempt returns Result.success(). The record becomes SUCCEEDED. If constraints become unmet during a run, WorkManager stops the worker and retries when they hold again.", "packets": [{"edge": "result", "label": "success", "tone": "back", "kind": "parcel"}], "set": {"nodes": {"record": ["is-done", "SUCCEEDED"], "worker": ["is-done", "success"]}, "visuals": {"worker": {"busy": false}}}}]}}, "illustrated": true, "edgeEndpoints": {"schedule": {"from": "record", "to": "system"}, "start": {"from": "system", "to": "worker"}, "result": {"from": "worker", "to": "record"}}}</script>
